      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Trim tops from baby beets. Gently wash, then arrange in a single layer in a shallow baking pan. Drizzle with olive oil and gently toss to coat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
